{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1484455-info-on-the-obscurer-dark-ages-roads","id":1484455,"title":"Info on the obscurer Dark Ages Roads","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-19T17:24:06-07:00","id":1484455,"title":"Info on the obscurer Dark Ages Roads","content":"Does anyone know of any setting info on the more obscure Roads (Bones, Blood, Typhoon, etc...) that covers them in similar manner to the Road books? I want to run a Dark Ages game in Constantinople and include various holidays, texts, and artifacts from the various Roads. The Road books are very helpful in not having to create stuff but I haven't found that level of detail on the more Clan affiliated Roads. Happy to check out any STV books as well. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3761-yab","name":"Yab","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-19T23:18:34-07:00","id":1484479,"title":"","content":"IMO, the key feature of the &quot;dark ages&quot; was the lack of information available and how localized everything was (this may not be so much the case in Constantinople)<br /> <br /> Because of this, The storyteller should be given a lot of creative licence.<br /> Perhaps the Road of Chivalry in Constantinople is very different from the same road in Athens, which is in turn very different from the Road of Chivalry in Prague. This will be even more extreme for the Niche roads like Bones, where you might have two or three influential authors and a lot of division on who's the most authoritative. (I wouldn't consider Blood or Typhon as obscure, given that they're the dominant roads for their respective sects, but I do expect FoS to have a lot of variations given their modus operandi)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}